{% for group in robots.default_groups %}
  {{- group.user_agent -}}

  {% for rule in group.rules %}
    {{- rule -}}
  {% endfor %}

  {%- if group.sitemap != blank -%}
    {{ group.sitemap }}
  {%- endif -%}
{% endfor %}

{%- comment -%}
  Named AI user-agent groups below use a bare "Allow: /", which
  replaces Shopify's default rules for those bots instead of adding
  to them. Without repeating the same disallow rules here, these
  bots are free to crawl cart, checkout, account and other utility
  URLs the wildcard group above blocks for everyone else. Reusing
  Shopify's own dynamic default rules (instead of hardcoding them)
  keeps this in sync if Shopify's defaults ever change.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture ai_bot_rules -%}
  {%- for group in robots.default_groups -%}
    {%- for rule in group.rules -%}
      {{ rule }}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endcapture -%}

# Google Gemini & AI Overviews
User-agent: Google-Extended
